content.content:
CLAUDE.md:17:文中で前の文に理由や補足を続けるダッシュ「—」は使わず、文を分けるか、括弧・読点で書く。見出しの区切り・箇条書きの項目名と説明の区切り・表の空欄のダッシュは使い続ける (経緯は [#87](https://github.com/akm/claude-plugins/issues/87))。
CONCEPTS.md:3:Shared domain vocabulary for this project — entities, named processes, and status concepts with project-specific meaning. Seeded with core domain vocabulary, then accretes as ce-compound and ce-compound-refresh process learnings; direct edits are fine. Glossary only, not a spec or catch-all.
---
{
  "filters": {
    "allowlist": {
      "allow": ["/「[^」\\n]*」/", "/\\|\\s*—\\s*(?=\\|)/"]
    }
  },
  "rules": {
    "preset-ja-no-ai-slop": {
      "literal-verb-translation": { "severity": "warning" },
      "vague-evaluative-ending": { "severity": "warning" },
      "calqued-metaphor": { "severity": "warning" },
      "sentence-connection": { "severity": "warning" },
      "foreign-field-term": false,
      "physical-verb-for-abstract": false,
      "nominalized-kango": false,
      "person-word-for-code": false,
      "unspecified-behavior": false,
      "request-in-condition": false
    },
    "ja-no-redundant-expression": { "severity": "warning" }
---
